testcase name="the start hook reports the session the agent names, which a resume continues"
testcase name="it reports its session, reads its brief, writes the beat&apos;s files, commits and reports done"
testcase name="it asks with norn ask; resumed, it continues the same session without reporting a new one, and plays the beat&apos;s resumed work"
testcase name="a step&apos;s beat without an attempt plays at every visit, and reports stuck with norn stuck"
testcase name="a beat that exits dies without a report, a stop or an end, as a crashed session does"
testcase name="a fresh session that norn&apos;s brief calls a retry of a dead one plays the beat&apos;s resumed work, reporting its own session"
testcase name="a visit the beat script has no beat for reports stuck, naming it"
testcase name="a beat that writes outside the worktree is refused with a stuck, and nothing is written"
testcase name="a brief it cannot read ends the session with a stop and an end, reporting nothing"
testcase name="a tool call norn denies is not made: nothing is written, and the agent reports stuck with norn&apos;s reason"
testcase name="an ask or a permission keeps one id at every instant it is open, so it never flickers"
testcase name="ask-question: without subagents: none of its events, and never its activity"
testcase name="ask-question: without limits: none of its events, and never its activity"
